[2656]="7000AC63\n1\tBring the Cardolan trinket to Anglinn\030Collect a Cardolan trinket\tBarrows lie scattered across the Northern and Southern Barrow-downs. Anglinn is at the Bree Hunting Lodge in Bree-town, east of the Barrow-downs. The Ranger Anglinn has asked you to banish the wights beneath the Northern and Southern Barrow-downs and bring him trinkets of ancient Cardolan which they might be carrying.\n",
})
